🔄 Program 9 — Update a Student Record Using a Temporary File

📌 Description

This program demonstrates how to update an existing student record in a text file using a temporary file.

The original file is read, the required record is modified, and the updated contents are written into a temporary file. After processing, the temporary file replaces the original file.

🔑 Concepts Covered

- 🔄 Updating file records
- 📄 Temporary-file technique
- 🔍 Searching for a record
- ✏️ Modifying record data
- 🔁 Replacing the original file
- ⚠️ File-operation error handling

📁 Files Used

- "students.txt"
- "students_temp.txt"

🧠 Main Concept

Read → Modify → Write Temporary File → Replace Original
